---
/**
 * @component SecurityHeaders
 * @description Implements comprehensive security headers to protect against common web vulnerabilities
 * 
 * Security implementation notes:
 * - CSP directives use a hash-based approach for inline scripts and styles
 * - The 'unsafe-inline' directive in this component serves as a fallback
 * - During build, a script generates SHA-256 hashes of all inline scripts and styles
 * - Hashes replace 'unsafe-inline' in the _headers file for production
 * 
 * @license
